  nameEnglish: The Reluctant Savior
  descriptionEnglish: Azaus' Pistol is a small and unassuming weapon that he reluctantly
    carries with him as a last resort. Azaus had lost his trusty weapon, the "Annihilator,"
    on his way to the Cathedral, leaving him with no choice but to resort to this
    pitiful pistol until he could find a more suitable replacement.
  nameChinese: "\u6700\u540E\u624B\u6BB5"
  descriptionChinese: "\u963F\u624E\u65AF\u7684\u624B\u67AA\u662F\u4E00\u652F\u5C0F\u5DE7\u800C\u4E0D\u8D77\u773C\u7684\u6B66\u5668\uFF0C\u4ED6\u4E0D\u60C5\u613F\u5730\u5C06\u5176\u4F5C\u4E3A\u6700\u540E\u7684\u624B\u6BB5\u643A\u5E26\u5728\u8EAB\u8FB9\u3002\u963F\u624E\u65AF\u5728\u524D\u5F80\u5927\u6559\u5802\u7684\u8DEF\u4E0A\u5931\u53BB\u4E86\u4ED6\u53EF\u9760\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u201C\u6BC1\u706D\u8005\u201D\uFF0C\u53EA\u80FD\u5C06\u8FD9\u652F\u53EF\u601C\u7684\u624B\u67AA\u5F53\u505A\u4EE3\u66FF\uFF0C\u76F4\u5230\u4ED6\u627E\u5230\u66F4\u5408\u9002\u7684\u66FF\u4EE3\u54C1\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Salvadora Relutante
  descriptionPortuguese: "A pistola de Azaus \xE9 uma arma pequena e discreta que
    ele carrega relutantemente consigo como \xFAltimo recurso. Azaus havia perdido
    sua arma confi\xE1vel, a \"Aniquiladora\", a caminho da Catedral, deixando-o
    sem escolha sen\xE3o recorrer a essa pistola pat\xE9tica at\xE9 que pudesse encontrar
    uma substitui\xE7\xE3o mais adequada."
  nameSpanish: El Salvador Renuente
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "La pistola de Azaus es un arma peque\xF1a y discreta
    que lleva a rega\xF1adientes consigo como \xFAltimo recurso. Azaus hab\xEDa perdido
    su confiable arma, el \u201CAniquilador\u201D, en su camino hacia la Catedral,
    dej\xE1ndolo sin otra opci\xF3n que recurrir a esta pistola miserable hasta que
    pudiera encontrar un reemplazo m\xE1s adecuado."
